From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:19:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 224/342] NeoCam: clips with sound from the audio input

CodyCam's recorder can take a sound track (AAC, else FLAC), written as
it comes from the first picture on, so both start together. NeoCam
connects the default audio input (a webcam's microphone) with a
BMediaRecorder while a clip records; "Record sound" on the Capture tab,
on by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
